        <mxCell id="netNote" value="&lt;b&gt;Network boundaries&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;No VPC by design (D14): all services are managed and reached over HTTPS. Only public entry: CloudFront. S3 buckets private (OAC). Organizer/admin API behind the Cognito JWT authorizer. Least-privilege IAM role per Lambda." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#147EBA;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
